{"fps": 30, "frames": 1625, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 134, "text": "In nineteen oh two, a city paid people to kill rats, and made the problem worse.", "words": [{"w": "In", "f": 0, "e": 4}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 4, "e": 17}, {"w": "oh", "f": 18, "e": 22}, {"w": "two,", "f": 22, "e": 29}, {"w": "a", "f": 30, "e": 32}, {"w": "city", "f": 33, "e": 40}, {"w": "paid", "f": 40, "e": 47}, {"w": "people", "f": 48, "e": 58}, {"w": "to", "f": 58, "e": 62}, {"w": "kill", "f": 63, "e": 70}, {"w": "rats,", "f": 70, "e": 79}, {"w": "and", "f": 79, "e": 85}, {"w": "made", "f": 85, "e": 92}, {"w": "the", "f": 93, "e": 98}, {"w": "problem", "f": 99, "e": 110}, {"w": "worse.", "f": 111, "e": 121}]}, {"a": 134, "b": 254, "text": "Imagine you're in Hanoi. The French just built shiny new sewers.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 136, "e": 146}, {"w": "you're", "f": 147, "e": 156}, {"w": "in", "f": 157, "e": 160}, {"w": "Hanoi.", "f": 161, "e": 184}, {"w": "The", "f": 185, "e": 189}, {"w": "French", "f": 190, "e": 199}, {"w": "just", "f": 200, "e": 206}, {"w": "built", "f": 207, "e": 215}, {"w": "shiny", "f": 216, "e": 223}, {"w": "new", "f": 224, "e": 229}, {"w": "sewers.", "f": 230, "e": 240}]}, {"a": 254, "b": 337, "text": "To a rat, that's a cozy palace with no cats.", "words": [{"w": "To", "f": 256, "e": 259}, {"w": "a", "f": 260, "e": 262}, {"w": "rat,", "f": 263, "e": 270}, {"w": "that's", "f": 271, "e": 281}, {"w": "a", "f": 282, "e": 284}, {"w": "cozy", "f": 285, "e": 292}, {"w": "palace", "f": 293, "e": 302}, {"w": "with", "f": 303, "e": 310}, {"w": "no", "f": 311, "e": 315}, {"w": "cats.", "f": 316, "e": 324}]}, {"a": 337, "b": 408, "text": "Rats start popping out of fancy toilets.", "words": [{"w": "Rats", "f": 339, "e": 345}, {"w": "start", "f": 346, "e": 353}, {"w": "popping", "f": 354, "e": 365}, {"w": "out", "f": 366, "e": 371}, {"w": "of", "f": 371, "e": 375}, {"w": "fancy", "f": 376, "e": 383}, {"w": "toilets.", "f": 384, "e": 396}]}, {"a": 408, "b": 493, "text": "So the city hires catchers to crawl into the muck.", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 410, "e": 413}, {"w": "the", "f": 414, "e": 418}, {"w": "city", "f": 419, "e": 425}, {"w": "hires", "f": 426, "e": 434}, {"w": "catchers", "f": 435, "e": 446}, {"w": "to", "f": 447, "e": 450}, {"w": "crawl", "f": 451, "e": 459}, {"w": "into", "f": 460, "e": 466}, {"w": "the", "f": 466, "e": 471}, {"w": "muck.", "f": 472, "e": 479}]}, {"a": 493, "b": 568, "text": "One June day, they catch over twenty thousand.", "words": [{"w": "One", "f": 495, "e": 499}, {"w": "June", "f": 500, "e": 506}, {"w": "day,", "f": 507, "e": 512}, {"w": "they", "f": 513, "e": 519}, {"w": "catch", "f": 520, "e": 527}, {"w": "over", "f": 528, "e": 534}, {"w": "twenty", "f": 535, "e": 543}, {"w": "thousand.", "f": 544, "e": 557}]}, {"a": 568, "b": 603, "text": "Barely a dent. So, a new offer.", "words": [{"w": "Barely", "f": 570, "e": 573}, {"w": "a", "f": 574, "e": 575}, {"w": "dent.", "f": 576, "e": 579}, {"w": "So,", "f": 580, "e": 581}, {"w": "a", "f": 582, "e": 583}, {"w": "new", "f": 584, "e": 585}, {"w": "offer.", "f": 586, "e": 590}]}, {"a": 603, "b": 738, "text": "One cent per rat. Just bring a tail to city hall.", "words": [{"w": "One", "f": 605, "e": 612}, {"w": "cent", "f": 613, "e": 621}, {"w": "per", "f": 622, "e": 628}, {"w": "rat.", "f": 629, "e": 651}, {"w": "Just", "f": 652, "e": 660}, {"w": "bring", "f": 661, "e": 685}, {"w": "a", "f": 686, "e": 689}, {"w": "tail", "f": 690, "e": 698}, {"w": "to", "f": 699, "e": 704}, {"w": "city", "f": 705, "e": 713}, {"w": "hall.", "f": 714, "e": 724}]}, {"a": 738, "b": 815, "text": "Nobody wants a mountain of dead rats at the office.", "words": [{"w": "Nobody", "f": 740, "e": 747}, {"w": "wants", "f": 748, "e": 755}, {"w": "a", "f": 756, "e": 757}, {"w": "mountain", "f": 758, "e": 769}, {"w": "of", "f": 769, "e": 772}, {"w": "dead", "f": 773, "e": 778}, {"w": "rats", "f": 779, "e": 785}, {"w": "at", "f": 786, "e": 788}, {"w": "the", "f": 789, "e": 793}, {"w": "office.", "f": 794, "e": 803}]}, {"a": 815, "b": 894, "text": "Tails pour in. Then, something strange.", "words": [{"w": "Tails", "f": 817, "e": 825}, {"w": "pour", "f": 826, "e": 831}, {"w": "in.", "f": 832, "e": 837}, {"w": "Then,", "f": 838, "e": 855}, {"w": "something", "f": 856, "e": 869}, {"w": "strange.", "f": 869, "e": 881}]}, {"a": 894, "b": 1000, "text": "Rats running around town, alive, healthy, and without tails.", "words": [{"w": "Rats", "f": 896, "e": 902}, {"w": "running", "f": 903, "e": 914}, {"w": "around", "f": 915, "e": 925}, {"w": "town,", "f": 926, "e": 934}, {"w": "alive,", "f": 935, "e": 945}, {"w": "healthy,", "f": 946, "e": 958}, {"w": "and", "f": 959, "e": 964}, {"w": "without", "f": 965, "e": 976}, {"w": "tails.", "f": 977, "e": 987}]}, {"a": 1000, "b": 1109, "text": "How is that possible? Inspectors outside town find rat farms.", "words": [{"w": "How", "f": 1002, "e": 1006}, {"w": "is", "f": 1007, "e": 1010}, {"w": "that", "f": 1011, "e": 1017}, {"w": "possible?", "f": 1018, "e": 1045}, {"w": "Inspectors", "f": 1046, "e": 1060}, {"w": "outside", "f": 1061, "e": 1071}, {"w": "town", "f": 1072, "e": 1078}, {"w": "find", "f": 1079, "e": 1085}, {"w": "rat", "f": 1086, "e": 1091}, {"w": "farms.", "f": 1092, "e": 1100}]}, {"a": 1109, "b": 1243, "text": "You see, it's like paying a kid per page read. Suddenly they love huge letters.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 1111, "e": 1115}, {"w": "see,", "f": 1116, "e": 1122}, {"w": "it's", "f": 1123, "e": 1129}, {"w": "like", "f": 1130, "e": 1135}, {"w": "paying", "f": 1136, "e": 1145}, {"w": "a", "f": 1146, "e": 1147}, {"w": "kid", "f": 1148, "e": 1153}, {"w": "per", "f": 1154, "e": 1158}, {"w": "page", "f": 1159, "e": 1165}, {"w": "read.", "f": 1166, "e": 1187}, {"w": "Suddenly", "f": 1188, "e": 1199}, {"w": "they", "f": 1200, "e": 1206}, {"w": "love", "f": 1207, "e": 1212}, {"w": "huge", "f": 1213, "e": 1219}, {"w": "letters.", "f": 1220, "e": 1231}]}, {"a": 1243, "b": 1431, "text": "Kill a rat: one cent, once. Snip its tail and let it go: a cent today, and baby rats tomorrow.", "words": [{"w": "Kill", "f": 1245, "e": 1251}, {"w": "a", "f": 1252, "e": 1254}, {"w": "rat:", "f": 1255, "e": 1270}, {"w": "one", "f": 1271, "e": 1276}, {"w": "cent,", "f": 1277, "e": 1285}, {"w": "once.", "f": 1286, "e": 1294}, {"w": "Snip", "f": 1295, "e": 1315}, {"w": "its", "f": 1316, "e": 1321}, {"w": "tail", "f": 1322, "e": 1329}, {"w": "and", "f": 1330, "e": 1335}, {"w": "let", "f": 1336, "e": 1341}, {"w": "it", "f": 1342, "e": 1346}, {"w": "go:", "f": 1346, "e": 1352}, {"w": "a", "f": 1352, "e": 1364}, {"w": "cent", "f": 1365, "e": 1372}, {"w": "today,", "f": 1372, "e": 1382}, {"w": "and", "f": 1383, "e": 1388}, {"w": "baby", "f": 1389, "e": 1396}, {"w": "rats", "f": 1397, "e": 1403}, {"w": "tomorrow.", "f": 1404, "e": 1418}]}, {"a": 1431, "b": 1508, "text": "The bounty didn't kill rats. It farmed them.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 1433, "e": 1438}, {"w": "bounty", "f": 1439, "e": 1448}, {"w": "didn't", "f": 1449, "e": 1457}, {"w": "kill", "f": 1458, "e": 1464}, {"w": "rats.", "f": 1465, "e": 1472}, {"w": "It", "f": 1473, "e": 1476}, {"w": "farmed", "f": 1477, "e": 1486}, {"w": "them.", "f": 1487, "e": 1494}]}, {"a": 1508, "b": 1625, "text": "They weren't paying for fewer rats. They were paying for tails.", "words": [{"w": "They", "f": 1510, "e": 1515}, {"w": "weren't", "f": 1516, "e": 1524}, {"w": "paying", "f": 1525, "e": 1533}, {"w": "for", "f": 1534, "e": 1538}, {"w": "fewer", "f": 1539, "e": 1545}, {"w": "rats.", "f": 1546, "e": 1552}, {"w": "They", "f": 1553, "e": 1567}, {"w": "were", "f": 1568, "e": 1573}, {"w": "paying", "f": 1574, "e": 1582}, {"w": "for", "f": 1583, "e": 1587}, {"w": "tails.", "f": 1588, "e": 1595}]}]}